; What the two of you say on the way: setting out, at the camp (once Brisk has said there are
; highwaymen, it's their camp), at the fork, and on the path up to the barrow, far enough short of it
; to get a word in.
trigger bark-road-out 4 15 w=2 h=3 bark=road-out
trigger bark-road-camp 21 20 w=10 h=6 bark=road-camp
trigger bark-road-camp-bandits 21 20 w=10 h=6 bark=road-camp-bandits
trigger bark-road-fork 37 15 w=5 h=3 bark=road-fork
trigger bark-barrow-mouth 40 7 w=2 h=2 bark=barrow-mouth
